1
00:00:02,326 --> 00:00:05,076
Maybe there's no way out. Maybe we were born here.

2
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:08,910
- C'mon. We're gonna get through this. - I'm staying here.

3
00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:11,451
No. We're Rick and Morty. I'm not leaving without you.

4
00:00:12,243 --> 00:00:13,368
What did you say?

5
00:00:13,368 --> 00:00:16,202
I said I'm not leaving you in here. Come on. You're irreplaceable.

6
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:20,493
- What? - Oh my god.

7
00:00:20,493 --> 00:00:21,993
I know what I'm afraid of.

8
00:00:22,327 --> 00:00:24,619
I'm afraid you'd never say that in real life.

9
00:00:24,619 --> 00:00:26,619
I'm afraid that if I jumped into a hole,

10
00:00:26,619 --> 00:00:28,702
you wouldn't even bother jumping in after me.

11
00:00:28,702 --> 00:00:32,535
You'd just stand there and watch. This entire thing has been about me.

12
00:00:33,077 --> 00:00:35,994
You're not even in the hole, are you?

13
00:00:37,328 --> 00:00:39,244
Thank you for visiting the Fear Hole, Morty.

14
00:00:39,244 --> 00:00:42,703
Your fear of relying on Ric has been delicious.

15
00:00:42,703 --> 00:00:45,203
Dear God!

